    "event": "pull_request",
    "head_branch": "feature/trim-definitions-to-view",
    "head_commit_message": "feat(content): cut the definitions to what presentation reads (spec 39 step 9e-ii)\n\nUnitArms, BattleTuning, ContentRegistry, ArmourDef, StructurePlanDef and\nStructureFaceDef go, with ContentStore's tuning, armour and plan_from_export.\nUnitDef, ItemDef and WeaponDef keep only what the wave form panel reads, and\nNodeDef drops its plan. The crate keeps every schema field a class doesn't\ndeclare in the object's schema_kept metadata and writes it back, so saving a\nmap through MapFiles.write loses none. The scan of the traits the code reads\nmoves to cargo.\n\nWaived-by: Decision 157\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi4emoz9nCGmXx5jfP9",
